Third-party material in this repository
=======================================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code in driver/, shared/, tools/, rust/,
scripts/, docs/ and driverkit/.

It does NOT cover anything under resources/, which is included for reference
during development and is the work of others under terms this project has not
established. Details and provenance are in docs/provenance.md.

  resources/EMU-driver-master-wouter1-repo/
      Wouter Pasman's EMU-driver, from https://github.com/Wouter1/EMU-driver
      A macOS kernel extension, no longer maintained, which never supported
      Apple Silicon. Consult that repository for its licence.

  resources/zaudiodrivermac-code-r7-trunk-official-source/
  resources/zaudiodriverwin-code-r5-trunk-official-source/
      E-MU's own released CA0188/CA0189 driver source, for macOS and Windows.
      Distribution terms are unclear and have not been verified.

  resources/EMUU_MacAppDrv_US_1_50_07-last-official-driver.dmg
      E-MU's final macOS driver binary, 2011. Redistribution rights unverified.

No code from any of these was copied into this project. They were read to
understand the hardware's protocol, and the conclusions drawn from them are
recorded in docs/FINDINGS.md in this project's own words.

If you hold rights to any of this material and would prefer it not be
distributed here, please open an issue and it will be removed.
